  {
    "rating": 75,
    "text": "A charming little logic snack — the bamboo-pairing twist on the classic boats-style grid kept me thinking, and knowing every level has exactly one solution made each win feel earned."
  },
  {
    "rating": 55,
    "text": "Solid deduction at its core, but the flat vector look and missing sound make long sessions feel dry; I wanted undo support and bigger boards sooner."
  },
  {
    "rating": 90,
    "text": "Twelve hand-tuned-feeling puzzles, drag-marking, hints with cooldowns, three lives on the line — a pocket puzzler I finished in one sitting and immediately wanted more levels of."
  }
